  "description": "A spoken list of QUANTITIES as a HUD (e.g. sets of 3, 5 and 10): each item pops in as a warm glass card at chest height with a big gradient numeral and that many little boxes, then shrinks into a chip stacked top-left. The last item stays big; at the end the chips pop out one by one. Only for counts up to about 10, not for numbering a list (1, 2, 3\u2026): the boxes read as quantities.",
